          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Defaults to 'anonymous'. Ignored for media built from data the application already owns, whose object URL is same-origin by construction. Unlike the transport, a non-default CORS mode IS part of asset identity: it is baked into the element, so a null and an 'anonymous' media resource for one URL are two assets, and a consumer never receives an element whose CORS mode it did not ask for."
